urious residences and spacious offices. We provide exceptional quality construction, capacious development and utmost sophistication in designing, architecture and amenities that are synonymous with luxury.\n\nOur buildings, in addition to increasing the aesthetic value of the property, increase the sense of comfort within these apartments. The presence of exceptional amenities contributes to the definition of luxury residential properties.\n\nOngoing\n\n## Projects\n\n## Navkar Residency A wing\n\n## South Pond Road, Vile Parle West\n\n## Splendid 2 & 3 BHK\n\n## Navkar Residency B wing\n\n## Bajaj Road, Vile Parle West [...] ## Navkar Residency B wing\n\n## Bajaj Road, Vile Parle West\n\n## Elegant 2 & 3 BHK\n\nCompleted\n\n## Projects\n\nNavkar Residency A wing\nNavkar Residency B Wing\nNavkar Poonam\nMahant Apartments (A,B,C & D Wing) – Old Nagardas Road, Andheri East\nSiddhant Complex (A,B & C Wing) – Old Nagardas Road, Andheri East\nNavkar – K.D. Road, Vile Parle West\n\n## Site Map\n\n## Ongoing Project\n\n## Completed Project\n\n## Navkar Construction\n\nAddress:  \nG-1, Shivkrupa, \"H\" Wing,  \nOld Nagardas Road,  \nAndheri East,  \nMumbai 400069\n\nPhone: 9137836216\n\nLandline: 022-35418804\n\nEmail: navkar.construction@yahoo.com","score":0.68571854,"raw_content":null,"id":"c83309-04"},{"url":"https://navkarcitynaigaoneast.in","title":"Navkar City Naigaon | Affordable Luxury Living","content":"Image 1: Navkar developer\n\nImage 2: Navkar developer\n\n   Home\n   Price\n   Site & Floor Plan\n   Amenities\n   Gallery\n   Location\n   Virtual Site Visit\n   Download Brochure\n\nImage 3: First slide\n\nImage 4: Second slide\n\nBiggest Launch At Naigaon East\n\nNavkar Majestic\n\nAt Naigaon East by Navkar Developers\n\nLand Parcel :15 Acres\n\nFloors : 23 Storeys\n\nPossession : Dec 2025\n\n 👉🏻 Early Bird offer\n\n 👉🏻 Spot Booking Discount \n\n Book Karo Rent Hum Bharenge Navkar Majestic R2 1 BHK - 390 Carpet Area Start from 36:99 lakh All in package Rent : 9000/-\n\n2 BHK - 580 Carpet Area Start From 57.99lakh All in package Rent:- 12000/- Download Brochure \n\n# Welcome to Navkar City Naigaon East [...] ## Our Projects\n\nNavkar Developers has successfully delivered several residential projects in Naigaon East and other parts of Mumbai. Our flagship project, Navkar City Naigaon, is a testament to our commitment to excellence and innovation. This project offers a range of modern amenities, spacious residences, and green spaces, making it a sought-after destination for homebuyers.\n\nAt Navkar Developers, we are dedicated to creating spaces that our customers are proud to call home. We look forward to continuing our journey of growth and success by building more communities that reflect our core values of quality, integrity, and customer satisfaction.\n\nRERA Information\n\nMahaRERA Registration No: P99000011999, P99000010920, P99000004573, P99000034105 Available at: [...] Image 12: Outdoor Seating area\nOutdoor Seating Area\n\nImage 13: Kid's play area\nKid's Play Area\n\nImage 14: Outdoor game\nOutdoor Game\n\nImage 15: Mini Theatre\nMini Theatre\n\nImage 16: swimming pool\nSwimming Pool\n\nDownload Amenities\n\n## Gallery\n\nDownload Gallery\n\nImage 17: navakar gallery\n\nImage 18: navakar gallery\n\nImage 19: navakar gallery\n\nImage 20: navakar gallery\n\nImage 21: navakar gallery\n\nImage 22: navakar gallery\n\nImage 23: navakar gallery\n\nImage 24: navakar gallery\n\nDownload Gallery\n\nVirtual Tour RequestImage 25: vertual tour Image 26: vertual tour Virtual Site Visit Navkar City Naigaon Virtual Site visit\n\nImage 27: Navkar developer\n\nAbout Navkar Developer:\n\nChat with us","score":0.6760432,"raw_content":null,"id":"c12df5-05"},{"url":"https://navkaromnia.in","title":"Navkar Omnia Mahalaxmi | 1 BHK Flats in Mumbai","content":"Amenities like, gymnasium, landscaped garden, children's play area, indoor games room, jogging track, yoga and meditation zone, The project features a premium","score":0.6742441,"raw